{
"label": "",
"lines": [],
"app": [
{
"n": 1,
"text": "Dhammapadassa vaggassuddānaṁ Yamakaṁ Pamādaṁ Cittaṁ, Pupphaṁ Bālañca Paṇḍitaṁ. Rahantaṁ Sahassaṁ Pāpaṁ, Daṇḍaṁ Jarā Attalokaṁ. Buddhaṁ Sukhaṁ Piyaṁ Kodhaṁ, Malaṁ Dhammaṭṭhamaggañca. Pakiṇṇakaṁ Nirayaṁ Nāgaṁ, Taṇhā Bhikkhu ca Brāhmaṇo. Gāthāyuddānaṁ Yamake vīsagāthāyo, Appamādalokamhi ca. Piye dvādasa gāthāyo, Citte Jarattekādasa. Pupphabālasahassamhi, Buddha Magga Pakiṇṇake. Soḷasa Paṇḍite Kodhe, Niraye Nāge catuddasa. Arahante dasaggāthā, Pāpasukhamhi terasa. Sattarasa Daṇḍadhammaṭṭhe, Malamhi ekavīsati. Taṇhāvagge sattabbīsa, tevīsa Bhikkhuvaggamhi. Brāhmaṇe ekatālīsa, catussatā satevīsa. (Ka)",
"variants": [],
"xrefs": []
}
]
}
