{
"label": "Udāne vaggānamuddānaṁ",
"lines": [
"Vaggamidaṁ paṭhamaṁ varabodhi, vaggamidaṁ dutiyaṁ Mucalindo.",
"Nandakavaggavaro tatiyo tu, Meghiyavaggavaro ca catuttho.",
"Pañcamavaggavarantidha Soṇo, chaṭṭhamavaggavaranti Jaccandho.",
"Sattamavaggavaranti ca Cūḷo, Pāṭaligāmiyamaṭṭhamavaggo.",
"Asītimanūnakasuttavaraṁ, vaggamidaṭṭhakaṁ suvibhattaṁ.",
"Dassitaṁ cakkhumatā vimalena, addhā hi taṁ udānamitīdamāhu."
],
"app": []
},
